<title>USA: Astrosystems loses Nasdaq listing.</title>
<headline>Astrosystems loses Nasdaq listing.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Astrosystems Inc said Monday that it is no longer eligible for listing on the Nasdaq Stock Market.</p>
<p>The company said in a release that it has applied for listing on the NASD OTC Electronic Bulletin Board.</p>
<p>It said it was removed from listing effective November 26.</p>
</text>
